{"4853740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crownrats", "steam_appid": 4853740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.poster.avif?t=1787151287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.webm?t=1787151287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.mp4?t=1787151287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crownrats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownrats</strong> is a co-op colony RPG about a small mouse settlement trying to survive and expand in a dangerous forest. Start from a home colony, explore procedurally generated rooms, push through narrow passages, clear fog of war, gather resources, build defenses, recruit allies and capture new territory. Every run creates a different forest layout with mines, markets, watchposts, wild animals, weather hazards and rival enemy colonies. Play solo with bot companions or prepare for co-op runs where players share the same colony, fight together, divide tasks, and react to raids in real time. Your team can mine resources, defend rooms, help develop the village and sometimes launch their own risky expeditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crownrats you can receive Steam in-game items just by completing runs, either in Co-op or Single Mode. Each time, one per several hours, you will receive a random weapon, which you can use further in battles or sell or trade on the community market. Chances for receiving a drop (subject for a change): </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common:</strong> 60%</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon:</strong> 25%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare:</strong> 10%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exotic:</strong> 3,5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic:</strong> 1%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient:</strong> 0,35%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine:</strong> 0,15%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crownrats many enemies await you. You will face:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ rooms to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ weapons to choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the exploration with your friends right in the co-op mode available!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.poster.avif?t=1787151287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.webm?t=1787151287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/extras/0c30c37d90029a0e832b61c485d5a491.mp4?t=1787151287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crownrats</