ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ rooms to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ weapons to choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the exploration with your friends right in the co-op mode available!</h2>", "short_description": "Crownrats is a co-op colony RPG where mouse heroes explore locations, capture rooms, mine resources, build a home colony and resist rival warrens. Play solo with bots or together in quick tactical runs.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Malay, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/b2f1dba53f2b5c702de54740f723fdd5777c18bf/header.jpg?t=1787151287", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/1d482434e50c51f4d9efbe790095d07a1e8121de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787151287", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853740/1d482434e50c51f4d9efbe790095d07a1e8121de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787151287", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 7700 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><